Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.12,0:00:05.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}克拉克森的农场 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.36,0:00:12.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}第27集 爬行
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.60,0:00:22.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}与科茨沃尔德区议会 开完会的第二天早上
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.60,0:00:22.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}The morning after my meeting with Cotswold District Council,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.60,0:00:26.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我撤回了 购买"马车与马"酒吧的要约
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.60,0:00:26.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I withdrew my offer to buy the Coach & Horses.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.80,0:00:29.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}对我来说 这是悲伤的一天
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.80,0:00:29.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}This was a sad day for me,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.84,0:00:33.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}对这座可爱的老建筑来说 同样是悲伤的一天
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.84,0:00:33.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}and a sad day too for this lovely old building.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.88,0:00:37.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}尽管心情非常低落
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.88,0:00:37.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}But even though I was feeling quite deflated,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.92,0:00:40.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我不得不将注意力转到一个
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.92,0:00:40.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I had to turn my attention to a problem
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.16,0:00:43.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}正在影响这片土地上 所有农民的问题上来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.16,0:00:43.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}that was affecting every farmer in the land:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.88,0:00:50.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}反复出现的恶劣天气 再次抬起了它丑陋的头
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.88,0:00:50.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}the weather, which, like a stuck record, had reared its ugly head yet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.48,0:00:55.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}六个月来 农场上空一直是一片灰色
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.48,0:00:55.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}There have been grey skies over farming for six months now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.12,0:00:58.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}被水浸透的土地意味着灾难
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.12,0:00:58.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}The sodden ground spells disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.24,0:00:59.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}庄稼已经开始腐烂
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.24,0:00:59.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Crops are already rotting,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.72,0:01:03.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}许多养殖户的草场已经变成了泥地
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.72,0:01:03.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}while many with livestock have seen grazing land turn into mud.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.48,0:01:07.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}2024年 土地太湿了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.48,0:01:07.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}In 2024, the ground is simply too wet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.00,0:01:09.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这一次的问题是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.00,0:01:09.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}This time, the problem was
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.76,0:01:14.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}持续的雨水几乎贯穿了整个暖冬
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.76,0:01:14.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}we'd had almost continuous rain throughout a mild winter.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.92,0:01:17.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}在过去188年的气象记录中
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.92,0:01:17.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}In the past 188 years of weather records,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.88,0:01:20.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我们从未经历过比今年更潮湿的二月
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.88,0:01:20.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}we've never had a wetter February than the one we saw this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.12,0:01:24.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}时间已经进入了四月的播种季
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.12,0:01:24.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And now we were into the April planting season,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.28,0:01:25.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}每个人都一筹莫展
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.28,0:01:25.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}everyone was stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.96,0:01:29.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}没有人能够 在被雨水浸透的土地上播种
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.96,0:01:29.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}No one could get their crops into the sodden ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.08,0:01:32.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}而雨水还在下个不停
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.08,0:01:32.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And it was still raining.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.24,0:01:35.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}无论在精神 财务还是其他方面 我们都已经承受不住了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.24,0:01:35.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Mentally, financially, anything, we can't carry on like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.64,0:01:39.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我们像所有人一样受到了影响
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.64,0:01:39.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}We'd been hit, the same as everyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.96,0:01:42.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}接连不断的雨水
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.96,0:01:42.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Rain, rain, rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.40,0:01:46.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}耽误了耕种 无法喷洒 无法施肥 无法播种
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.40,0:01:46.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It's stopped progress. No spraying, no fertilising, no drilling.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.00,0:01:48.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}雨水下个不停
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.00,0:01:48.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It just keeps on coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.20,0:01:59.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这让我和查理关于庄稼的讨论 更像是一次危机峰会
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.20,0:01:59.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}This meant my crop chat with Charlie was more of a crisis summit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.20,0:02:04.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我不想讨论雨水的问题 自从开始制作
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.20,0:02:04.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I don't want to go on about rainfall 'cause we've done that
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.72,0:02:07.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}《克拉克森的农场》 几乎每期节目都会谈到天气
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.72,0:02:07.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}in every single programme since we started making Clarkson's Farm.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.16,0:02:09.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}自从你开始经营农场以来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.16,0:02:09.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Basically, since you started farming.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.28,0:02:12.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}天气就没好过 雨就没停过
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.28,0:02:12.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It hasn't stopped raining. The weather's been rubbish.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.24,0:02:14.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}一个好年景都没遇到过
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.24,0:02:14.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I haven't had one proper year yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.20,0:02:16.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}是的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.20,0:02:16.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.68,0:02:18.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这是我复印的《泰晤士报》的文章
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.68,0:02:18.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I printed this out from The Times.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.12,0:02:22.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}"受够了雨天 你应该看看1872年"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.12,0:02:22.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}"Sick of all this rain? You should have seen 1872.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.84,0:02:27.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}"截至1872年12月 雨已经连续下了12个月
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.84,0:02:27.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}By December 1872, after 12 months of continuous rain,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.28,0:02:30.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}英格兰完全是一派世界末日的景象"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.28,0:02:30.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}conditions in England were little short of apocalyptic."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.72,0:02:32.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}至少《泰晤士报》是这样说的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.72,0:02:32.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}At least according to The Times.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.80,0:02:36.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}"田里的老鼠像野兔一样多 卷心菜惨遭洗劫"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.80,0:02:36.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}"In the fields, rats as plentiful as hares ravaged the cabbages.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.76,0:02:39.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}"在剑桥 划船训练的地点 改在了铁路道沟"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.76,0:02:39.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}In Cambridge, rowers practised in railway ditches.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.12,0:02:42.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}"河水涌入了莱斯特城的地窖"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.12,0:02:42.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Rivers flowed into the cellars of Leicester.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.64,0:02:47.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}"坎特伯雷大主教主持了 祈求晴天的紧急祷告活动"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.64,0:02:47.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}The Archbishop of Canterbury was leading emergency prayers for blue sky."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.84,0:02:49.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这是1872年 懂吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.84,0:02:49.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}That was in 1872, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.92,0:02:52.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}"那年英格兰的降雨量有多少"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.92,0:02:52.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}"And how much rain did we have in England that year?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.52,0:02:56.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}"与过去12个月的降雨量大致相当"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.52,0:02:56.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Roughly the same as has fallen in the past 12 months."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.24,0:02:58.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}有意思吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.24,0:02:58.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Interesting, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.28,0:03:00.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}1872年 坎特伯雷大主教还会祷告
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.28,0:03:00.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}1872, they had the Archbishop of Canterbury praying...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.00,0:03:02.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}天气放晴 停止降雨
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.00,0:03:02.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}For blue sky! For it to stop raining.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.00,0:03:06.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不可思议 现在我们会说 "这个雨真讨厌" 对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.00,0:03:06.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}That's amazing. And now we're just sitting here going, "Oh, bloody nuisance, this rain, innit?"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.60,0:03:08.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我们快要习以为常了 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.60,0:03:08.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}We're getting used to it. Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.68,0:03:12.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}总之 现在是4月3号或4号
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.68,0:03:12.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Anyway. It's now April the... 3rd or 4th.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.96,0:03:19.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}现在距离播种硬粒小麦的 最后期限还有多长时间
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.96,0:03:19.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}How much later can we go before we have to plant that durum wheat?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.76,0:03:26.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}用不了多久 产量就要迅速下降了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.76,0:03:26.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}We're getting to a point where the yield is dropping off quite quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.64,0:03:30.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这周剩下的时间 天气预报都是雨天
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.64,0:03:30.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And the weather forecast for the rest of this week is rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.32,0:03:31.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}是的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.32,0:03:31.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.32,0:03:33.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}"周一 雨 周二 雨
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.32,0:03:33.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Monday, rain. Tuesday, rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.60,0:03:37.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}周三 雨 周五 雨 周六 雨"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.60,0:03:37.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Wednesday, rain. Friday, rain. Saturday, rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.16,0:03:40.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}前景不妙 是吧 我们应该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.16,0:03:40.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It's not a good outlook, is it? What the fuck are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.16,0:03:43.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}硬粒小麦还没种
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.16,0:03:43.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}We haven't got the durum wheat planted.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.24,0:03:46.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}黑麦草还没种 NUM3还没种
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.24,0:03:46.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}We haven't got the rye grass in. We haven't got the NUM3 in.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.24,0:03:49.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}草本牧地也都还没种
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.24,0:03:49.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And nor is all of the herbal ley.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.60,0:03:51.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}GS4 GS4
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.60,0:03:51.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}The GS4? The GS4.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.68,0:03:53.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}种了 我种的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.68,0:03:53.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}That is in. I planted it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.64,0:03:55.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}可能需要重新播种
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.64,0:03:55.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}We might have to re-drill it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.44,0:03:58.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}必须重新播种
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.44,0:03:58.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}We will have to re-drill it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.76,0:04:01.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我种的那块地 你种的那块地
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.76,0:04:01.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}The field I did? The field you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.52,0:04:03.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}没有发芽
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.52,0:04:03.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It's not growing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.28,0:04:05.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我昨天去了一趟农场商店
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.28,0:04:05.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I must say, I was up at the farm shop yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.64,0:04:06.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不对 是前天
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.64,0:04:06.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}No, day before yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.12,0:04:09.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}地里一片棕色 跟一个农民聊了一会儿
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.12,0:04:09.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It's quite brown. Talking to a farmer, I said,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.36,0:04:11.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我说 "我的GS4已经种好了"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.36,0:04:11.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}"I've got my GS4 in." And...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.32,0:04:14.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}他说 我大手一挥 他说 "在哪儿"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.32,0:04:14.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And he went... Expansive gesture! And he went, "Where?"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.40,0:04:19.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}嗯 他说得有道理 洒下的种子已经不在地里了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.40,0:04:19.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, he had a point. The seed went onto the ground and it's no longer there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.40,0:04:21.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我们需要它来喂养奶牛 问题就在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.40,0:04:21.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Shit, we need it to feed the cows. That's the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.04,0:04:24.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}如果今年要喂养奶牛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.04,0:04:24.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}If we want to feed the cows this year,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.08,0:04:28.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}就要尽快把GS4种上
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.08,0:04:28.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}we want the GS4 in quite quickly as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.32,0:04:32.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不过优先顺序很清楚 硬粒小麦 GS4
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.32,0:04:32.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}But, the priority is very easy: durum wheat, GS4.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.28,0:04:33.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}给我一个最后期限
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.28,0:04:33.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Give me a deadline.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.48,0:04:38.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}如果到了4月24日 硬粒小麦还没种上
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.48,0:04:38.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So if by the 24th of April we haven't got the durum in,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.92,0:04:40.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}那就麻烦了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.92,0:04:40.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}that's the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.56,0:04:43.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不过往年也试过五月才播种
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.56,0:04:43.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}But we have planted it in May before.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.24,0:04:45.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}收成呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.24,0:04:45.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And the yield was...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.04,0:04:47.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不理想
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.04,0:04:47.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Poor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.80,0:04:48.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.80,0:04:48.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.72,0:04:56.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}那是去年的日历 为什么没有换上今年的日历
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.72,0:04:56.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I think that's last year's calendar. Why haven't we gotten another calendar up?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.56,0:05:00.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我都不知道那是几月份 我去买个日历 把日期标出来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.56,0:05:00.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I don't even know what month that is. I'm gonna get a calendar and I'm gonna ring it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.92,0:05:02.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}24号 你的手机上就有日历
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.92,0:05:02.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}24th. There's one on your phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.92,0:05:05.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}是的 但我不能把手机挂在墙上
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.92,0:05:05.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yes, but I can't hang my phone on the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.88,0:05:07.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}也不是不行
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.88,0:05:07.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, you could.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.60,0:05:12.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}偶尔遇到不下雨的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.60,0:05:12.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}On the odd day when it didn't rain,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.60,0:05:16.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}地里依然是汪洋一片
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.60,0:05:16.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}the fields remained completely waterlogged.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.08,0:05:18.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你看这里水涝多严重
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.08,0:05:18.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Look how much flooding is over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.84,0:05:21.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}全是泛滥平原 老天
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.84,0:05:21.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, all floodplain. Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.76,0:05:25.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}因此 我和丽莎 利用这段时间继续寻找酒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.76,0:05:25.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Lisa and I, therefore, used the time to get back to pub hunting.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.72,0:05:29.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}让人难过的是 可供选择的酒吧非常多
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.72,0:05:29.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And, rather sadly, we were spoilt for choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.36,0:05:33.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我找过的每个酒吧老板 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.36,0:05:33.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Every single pub owner I went to... Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.44,0:05:36.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}每一个老板 都说打算卖掉自己的酒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.44,0:05:36.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Every single one said that their pub was for sale.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.92,0:05:38.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}无一例外
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.92,0:05:38.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Every single one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.48,0:05:40.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}老天 好吧 看看这个
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.48,0:05:40.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, my God. Like, so, if you look at this, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.80,0:05:42.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}嗯 1990年的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.80,0:05:42.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah? In 1990,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.68,0:05:45.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}每十万人有110家酒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.68,0:05:45.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}there was 110 pubs per 100,000 people.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.80,0:05:47.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}什么 英国吗 英国
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.80,0:05:47.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}What, in the UK? In the UK.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.96,0:05:52.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}到了2022年 大约是68家酒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.96,0:05:52.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And then, in 2022, there was about 68 pubs.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.52,0:05:55.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}所以从110减少到了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.52,0:05:55.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So it's fallen from 110... To 68.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.36,0:05:57.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}68 但是 每十万人68家 对
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.36,0:05:57.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}To 68, per 100,000 people. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.00,0:05:59.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}有很多酒吧正在出售
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.00,0:05:59.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I mean, there are so many for sale.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.96,0:06:01.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}非常多
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.96,0:06:01.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So many.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.04,0:06:05.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我们去的第一家酒吧 让人切实感受到了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.04,0:06:05.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}The first pub we visited was a heartfelt reminder
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.64,0:06:07.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}令人难过的衰败景象
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.64,0:06:07.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}of this sad decline.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.72,0:06:08.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你们还在营业 是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.72,0:06:08.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}But you're still open, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.12,0:06:12.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}没有 停业了 母亲节那天停业的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.12,0:06:12.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}No, we're not now. Oh, you're closed. Closed on Mother's Day.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.24,0:06:14.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}该死 我不 该死 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.24,0:06:14.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, shit. I didn't... Oh, shit. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.88,0:06:19.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}更让人难过的是 那绝对是一家堪称极品的酒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.88,0:06:19.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And what made it even more sad is that the pub was an absolute gem.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.68,0:06:20.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你看这个
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.68,0:06:20.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh wow, look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.96,0:06:23.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这栋房子很漂亮吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.96,0:06:23.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}This is a properly nice building, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.72,0:06:25.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}非常漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.72,0:06:25.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It's very, very charming.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.40,0:06:29.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不过 进出停车场的道路太窄 意味着它不适合我们
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.40,0:06:29.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}However, access to its car park meant it wasn't right for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.76,0:06:32.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}生意好的时候 有车要进去
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.76,0:06:32.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So, if it's busy and you've got cars coming in
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.12,0:06:35.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}有车要出来 会堵在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.12,0:06:35.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}and cars trying to get out, this is a gridlock right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.60,0:06:38.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}没错 这是个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.60,0:06:38.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I agree, I agree, I agree. That is an issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.40,0:06:39.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}对我们来说是个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.40,0:06:39.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}This is our issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.56,0:06:44.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}接下来这家酒吧同样很漂亮 也不存在停车的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.56,0:06:44.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}The next pub, another beauty, had no parking problems,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.32,0:06:48.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}带一个漂亮的花园 景色优美
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.32,0:06:48.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}a lovely garden, great views,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.68,0:06:51.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}内饰是典型的科茨沃尔德酒吧风格
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.68,0:06:51.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}and a proper Cotswold-pub interior.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.12,0:06:54.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}过来看看花园房
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.12,0:06:54.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Come and see the garden room.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.92,0:06:56.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}大小适中 空间流动性也不错
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.92,0:06:56.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It's a good size. It has a good flow to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.72,0:06:58.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}很漂亮吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.72,0:06:58.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It's very pretty, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.36,0:07:00.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}非常漂亮 对
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.36,0:07:00.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It's very, very charming. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.36,0:07:02.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}是的 这家不错
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.36,0:07:02.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh yeah, this'll do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.44,0:07:04.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}大小很合适 一家带风景的酒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.44,0:07:04.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It's a perfect size. It's a bar with a view as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.32,0:07:05.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}还是一个舞台 看啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.32,0:07:05.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It's a stage as well. Ta-da!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.08,0:07:08.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}看啊 我很喜欢有个吧台
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.08,0:07:08.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Ta-da! I do like a bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.68,0:07:10.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}但是要想在里面开商店
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.68,0:07:10.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}But if I wanted to put a shop in it,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.80,0:07:15.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}就必须被规划部门列为E类经营场所
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.80,0:07:15.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}it would have to be listed by the planners as a Class E establishment,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.32,0:07:16.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}而不仅仅是酒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.32,0:07:16.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}not just a pub.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.12,0:07:20.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你应该不清楚这家酒吧的规划 是否属于E类吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.12,0:07:20.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I don't suppose you know if you're Class E, do you, planning-wise?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.68,0:07:22.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这是酒吧还是餐厅 酒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.68,0:07:22.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Are you a pub or a restaurant? Er, pub.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.08,0:07:24.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}见鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.08,0:07:24.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.28,0:07:27.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.28,0:07:27.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.56,0:07:30.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}丽莎认为这不是什么大问题
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.56,0:07:30.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Lisa didn't think this was too much of a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.16,0:07:32.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}但我认为是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.16,0:07:32.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I did, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.88,0:07:35.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}在你申请规划许可期间 我们可以先把酒吧开起来
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.88,0:07:35.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}While you're doing planning permission, we could be up and running and busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.00,0:07:38.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}没错 但是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.00,0:07:38.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}No, that's true, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.24,0:07:42.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}如果最终拿不到规划许可 这就是一家酒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.24,0:07:42.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}If you don't ultimately get planning permission, I end up with a pub.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.44,0:07:43.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.44,0:07:43.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.28,0:07:47.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我想要的不是酒吧 我想要酒吧 商店和肉店的综合体
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.28,0:07:47.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And I don't want a pub. I want a pub and a shop and a butcher's.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.08,0:07:53.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我们看的最后一家酒吧 有一个大小合适的外屋
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.08,0:07:53.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Our final pub of the tour had good-sized outbuildings...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.96,0:07:55.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}农场商店 对
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.96,0:07:55.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Farm shop. Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.12,0:07:58.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}一个土壤透气性良好的花园
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.12,0:07:58.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}A garden with well-aerated soil,
