Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.84,0:12:27.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, it was good. A helluva experience. I'll bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.60,0:12:28.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你去了很长时间 老天
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.60,0:12:28.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Christ. It's been a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.88,0:12:31.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}看了很多不一样的农场 洋葱农场
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.88,0:12:31.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I've seen so many different farms. Onion farms.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.92,0:12:34.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}大奶牛农场 太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.92,0:12:34.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Big cow farms. It's been awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.44,0:12:36.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你就看了这些 还有山羊农场
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.44,0:12:36.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}That's all you've seen? And a goat farm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.28,0:12:37.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}山羊农场 我去了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.28,0:12:37.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Goat farms? I went to a place
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.12,0:12:40.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}威尔士附近的一个悬崖农场 我称之为"悬崖"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.12,0:12:40.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}near Wales which is like a cliff farm. I say "cliff"...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.68,0:12:44.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}因为他们在一个悬崖上放山羊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.68,0:12:44.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}They had sheep grazing on, like, a cliff like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.28,0:12:46.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}是吗 我心想"会有人掉下去吗"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.28,0:12:46.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I was like, "Will they fall?" Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.20,0:12:47.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}天气不错
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.20,0:12:47.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Weather's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.20,0:12:49.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你走了之后就没停过 我知道 很糟糕
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.20,0:12:49.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Hasn't stopped since you left. I know! It's bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.76,0:12:53.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你走了之后雨就没停过 有人会说我时机选得不错
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.76,0:12:53.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Hasn't stopped raining since you left. Some would said I timed it well, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.80,0:12:56.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}就像这样 你看到了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.80,0:12:56.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}But, it's like this. Anyway, as you can see...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.24,0:12:59.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我算是做到了 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.24,0:12:59.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I've managed. Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.52,0:13:01.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}干净的院子 一尘不染 井然有序
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.52,0:13:01.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Clean yard. Spotless. Everything tidy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.04,0:13:03.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}看起来像个农场院子 不错
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.04,0:13:03.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Looks like a farmyard. Looks good, doesn't it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.56,0:13:05.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}牛圈很干净 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.56,0:13:05.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Cows mucked out. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.36,0:13:07.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你肯定以为你回来的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.36,0:13:07.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I bet you thought it'd be all on fire
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.28,0:13:09.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}一切都乱糟糟的 动物死光了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.28,0:13:09.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}when you got back, all the animals dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.68,0:13:11.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}一片狼藉 没有 我一直在说
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.68,0:13:11.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Fire everywhere. No, 'cause I've been saying, actually,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.76,0:13:14.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我走到哪里都会夸奖你
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.76,0:13:14.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}everywhere I go, I've been praising you up actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.56,0:13:16.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我很惊讶 有件事你还没注意到
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.56,0:13:16.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}One thing I'm amazed you haven't noticed...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.96,0:13:20.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你买了那个 不是 借来试用的 为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.96,0:13:20.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, so have you bought that? No, it's on demo. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.36,0:13:22.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你走了之后 那台兰博基尼变得有点不靠谱
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.36,0:13:22.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}The Lamborghini's been a bit unreliable since you went.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.32,0:13:23.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}发生什么事了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.32,0:13:23.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Has it? What's happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.56,0:13:25.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}一言难尽 是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.56,0:13:25.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Everything. Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.56,0:13:26.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.56,0:13:26.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.56,0:13:28.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我不得不找人帮忙
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.56,0:13:28.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I've had to get help.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.72,0:13:32.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}发生什么事了 我不得不找了个帮手
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.72,0:13:32.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}What's happened? I had to get someone to help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.52,0:13:34.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.52,0:13:34.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.60,0:13:36.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我没听懂
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.60,0:13:36.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.24,0:13:39.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你将见到哈莉特 你会喜欢她的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.24,0:13:39.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}You'll meet Harriet. You'll like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.36,0:13:43.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.36,0:13:43.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.80,0:13:50.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我察觉到卡莱布 对于我请帮手的事有点不大高兴
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.80,0:13:50.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Sensing that Kaleb wasn't entirely happy about me hiring someone else,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.68,0:13:53.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}于是决定尽快带他去见她
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.68,0:13:53.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I decided he should meet her as quickly as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.24,0:13:59.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我们要去的地方 哈莉特的 她完成了大麦的播种
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.24,0:13:59.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So, where we're going now... Harriet's, where she's drilled the barley.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.44,0:14:02.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}好的 她干得好吗 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.44,0:14:02.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Okay. She done a good job? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.80,0:14:06.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}所以全都 你看 鼻涕虫一直在
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.80,0:14:06.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So, it's all coming up. Look, you can see the slugs have been...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.00,0:14:08.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}挖洞 向下挖洞
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.00,0:14:08.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Hammering it. Hammering it all the way down.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.56,0:14:12.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}好 那就是哈莉特 好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.56,0:14:12.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Right, now, that... that's Harriet, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.12,0:14:14.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.12,0:14:14.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.20,0:14:16.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}友好一点
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.20,0:14:16.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Now, be nice. Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.04,0:14:19.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}别乱来 我不想见到你 像上次跟安迪·卡托那样吵架
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.04,0:14:19.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Behave. I'm not having any of your Andy Cato nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.92,0:14:27.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这下有好戏看了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.92,0:14:27.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}This is going to be interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.48,0:14:31.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}他想鼓励年轻人干农活
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.48,0:14:31.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}'Cause he wants to encourage young people to start farming...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.12,0:14:35.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}但我不觉得 他会希望他们来这个农场干农活
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.12,0:14:35.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}but I don't think he wants them to farm on this farm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.84,0:14:38.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.84,0:14:38.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.60,0:14:41.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}很高兴认识你 你好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.60,0:14:41.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Lovely to meet you. Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.32,0:14:42.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你好吗 是的 你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.32,0:14:42.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}You okay. Yeah, you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.60,0:14:43.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我很好 你俩没见过 没有 还没有
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.60,0:14:43.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, yeah, have you not met? No, not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.12,0:14:45.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这是哈莉特 这是卡莱布
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.12,0:14:45.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Harriet, Kaleb.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.92,0:14:49.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这是你播的种 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.92,0:14:49.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Did you drill this? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.32,0:14:53.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}他在评判 对 检查
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.32,0:14:53.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Judgement here. Yeah, inspection.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.52,0:14:56.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}满意吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.52,0:14:56.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Look, are you pleased?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.52,0:14:59.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}大麦已经发芽了 是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.52,0:14:59.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}We've got barley germinating. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.08,0:15:04.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}好吧 他俩见面了 暂时还没吵起来
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.08,0:15:04.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Right, they've met, look, they've met. No actually fighting so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.96,0:15:06.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这是什么 鼻涕虫
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.96,0:15:06.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}What's that? Slugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.72,0:15:08.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}鼻涕虫 卡莱布
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.72,0:15:08.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Slugs, Kaleb.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.92,0:15:12.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你好吗 哈莉特 我很好 肥已经施了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.92,0:15:12.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}How are you, Harriet? Yeah, good. Fert's on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.92,0:15:14.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你施肥了 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.92,0:15:14.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}You got fert on? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.80,0:15:16.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}没有施错肥料吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.80,0:15:16.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Did you put the right fert on?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.12,0:15:20.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你发现了什么 查理 一个鼻涕虫
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.12,0:15:20.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}What have you found, Charlie? A slug.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.60,0:15:22.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这个冬天很暖和
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.60,0:15:22.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}This winter has been really warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.48,0:15:24.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}是的 所以出现了很多鼻涕虫
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.48,0:15:24.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. So we've got lots of slugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.72,0:15:27.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这块地里有多少
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.72,0:15:27.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And how many of them are there in this field?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.72,0:15:28.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}成百万
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.72,0:15:28.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Millions.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.20,0:15:30.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}成百万 是的 成百万
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.20,0:15:30.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Millions? Yeah, there'll be millions of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.36,0:15:35.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}它们会撕下叶子 吃掉叶子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.36,0:15:35.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}What they do is they just strip the leaf, they just eat the leaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.24,0:15:37.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}但是我们有鼻涕虫药丸 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.24,0:15:37.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}But, we have slug pellets. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.24,0:15:40.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}如果不撒鼻涕虫药丸 它们会吃掉大麦吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.24,0:15:40.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}If you didn't put slug pellets on, would that eat the barley?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.88,0:15:43.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}如果不撒 大麦就没了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.88,0:15:43.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}We would not have any barley if we hadn't put slug pellets.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.08,0:15:45.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}会全被吃光 没了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.08,0:15:45.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It would have all been eaten. None?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.72,0:15:48.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}有一次我在法国 因为鼻涕虫蹲过看守所
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.72,0:15:48.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I once had to go to prison in France because of a slug...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.08,0:15:51.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}真事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.08,0:15:51.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}True story.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.32,0:15:53.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我去一家名为"爱情苹果"的餐厅
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.32,0:15:53.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I went to a restaurant called La Pomme d'Amour,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.88,0:15:57.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我点的生菜里有一个鼻涕虫 餐厅的人非常抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.88,0:15:57.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}and there was a slug in my lettuce, and the man was so apologetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.16,0:16:00.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}他说 "酒随便喝 免费"
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.16,0:16:00.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}He said, "You can drink as much as you like on the house."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.40,0:16:04.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}当时我只有19岁 我心想"那就喝吧"
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.40,0:16:04.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And I was only 19, so I thought, "Well, I will, then."
