Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.92,0:27:04.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这家伙太有蛮力了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.92,0:27:04.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}This is just fucking brute force.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.20,0:27:05.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.20,0:27:05.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yes, yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.04,0:27:07.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}快把那些猪赶走
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.04,0:27:07.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Let them pigs go. Quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.28,0:27:11.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}见鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.28,0:27:11.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.40,0:27:14.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}真好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.40,0:27:14.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}That was fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.40,0:27:18.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}刚才挡板正撞在我的肋骨上
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.40,0:27:18.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}That board went, like, straight into my, like, rib.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.48,0:27:20.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不妙
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.48,0:27:20.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.16,0:27:22.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我需要一袋豆子
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.16,0:27:22.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I need a bag of peas.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.64,0:27:25.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}一袋豆子 是的 包治百病
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.64,0:27:25.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}A bag of peas. Yeah. Cures everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.08,0:27:32.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}没有人对哈维的离去依依不舍
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.08,0:27:32.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}No one was upset to see Harvey leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.96,0:27:37.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}但是迪丽斯库阿特又将迎来一次别离
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.96,0:27:37.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}But it was now time for another departure from Diddly Squat.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.08,0:27:40.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这次让人有点不舍
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.08,0:27:40.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And that was a bit sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.20,0:27:43.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}就这样了 你要走了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.20,0:27:43.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So this is it, you're off.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.08,0:27:46.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我要走了 你要回德比郡了 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.08,0:27:46.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm off. You're off back to Derbyshire? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.84,0:27:49.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你是一颗耀眼的明星 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.84,0:27:49.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Listen, you've been an absolute star. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.28,0:27:51.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}非常感谢你做的一切 非常棒
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.28,0:27:51.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Thanks ever so much for everything. Absolutely brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.12,0:27:53.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}谢谢 祝你好运
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.12,0:27:53.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Thanks. And best of luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.60,0:27:55.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.60,0:27:55.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. Erm...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.32,0:27:57.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}等大麦长出来了 我发照片给你
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.32,0:27:57.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And I'll send you pictures of the barley when it's growing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.56,0:28:00.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}嗯 要是没长出来 就别发了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.56,0:28:00.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, if there's any fuck-ups, don't send them to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.16,0:28:03.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}嗯 而且我不会告诉卡莱布 这很重要
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.16,0:28:03.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}No, I'm not. I'm not gonna tell Kaleb either, that's the important thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.56,0:28:05.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不客气 你解了我的燃眉之急
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.56,0:28:05.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Erm, saved my life, you did. Any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.00,0:28:07.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你很棒 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.00,0:28:07.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}You were brilliant. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.24,0:28:09.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}听着 万一还需要帮忙 我可以给你打电话吗
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.24,0:28:09.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So, listen, if we get stuck again, can I give you a call?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.56,0:28:10.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}可以
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.56,0:28:10.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.56,0:28:13.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}说一声就行了 抱歉 我换种问法 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.56,0:28:13.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Just let me know. No, sorry, let me re-phrase that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.24,0:28:14.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}下次我们需要帮忙的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.24,0:28:14.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}When we get stuck again.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.80,0:28:15.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}好的 尽管开口
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.80,0:28:15.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, ooh.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.76,0:28:16.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}好的 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.76,0:28:16.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}All right. All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.04,0:28:18.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}嗯 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.04,0:28:18.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.52,0:28:20.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我把拖车的门关上
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.52,0:28:20.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I'll close "t'e" caravan door.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.44,0:28:22.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}把拖车的门关上
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.44,0:28:22.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Close the caravan door.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.96,0:28:25.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}现在拖车归你了 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.96,0:28:25.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Your caravan now! Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.92,0:28:28.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}如果你和丽莎吵架了 她可以搬过来住
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.92,0:28:28.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}When you and Lisa fall out, she can come and live here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.24,0:28:31.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这个主意不错 她可以搬过来住
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.24,0:28:31.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I like your thinking. She can come and live here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.60,0:28:33.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我赞成
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.60,0:28:33.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I approve of that!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.76,0:28:35.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}开车注意安全 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.76,0:28:35.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}You drive carefully, won't you? All right, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.48,0:28:36.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}好的 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.48,0:28:36.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}All right, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.24,0:28:39.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}再见
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.24,0:28:39.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.28,0:28:44.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}没错 她是个超级巨星
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.28,0:28:44.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, she's a superstar, that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.84,0:28:51.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}现在卡莱布回来打理一切了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.84,0:28:51.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Now that Kaleb was back and fully in charge,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.08,0:28:54.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我可以继续寻找酒吧了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.08,0:28:54.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I could get back to my hunt for a pub.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.16,0:28:59.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}那家酒店名叫"剃须皇冠"
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.16,0:28:59.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So, that is called The Shaven Crown.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.68,0:29:02.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}有750年历史了 有个很棒的大厅
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.68,0:29:02.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}750 years old. It's got a great hall in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.08,0:29:05.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}漂亮的庭院 后面还有一个停车场
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.08,0:29:05.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It's got a beautiful courtyard and a car park round the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.92,0:29:07.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}而且处于待售状态
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.92,0:29:07.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And it is... for sale.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.04,0:29:12.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}那边转角处的酒吧也是
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.04,0:29:12.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And so is the pub just on that corner down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.32,0:29:16.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}一个村子两家酒吧 都处于待售状态
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.32,0:29:16.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Two pubs, one village, both for sale.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.76,0:29:20.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}只可惜 那天上午我看过的酒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.76,0:29:20.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Sadly, none of the pubs I saw that morning were right,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.12,0:29:23.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}都因为种种原因不太适合
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.12,0:29:23.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}for one reason or another.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.52,0:29:27.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}下午看了几家也是一样
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.52,0:29:27.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And nor were the multitude I saw that afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.52,0:29:34.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这家酒吧要想维持经营
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.52,0:29:34.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}If you were to make this economically viable,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.40,0:29:38.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}需要每周七天 每天有八十到一百人来用餐
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.40,0:29:38.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}you'd need 80 or 100, lunch and dinner, 7 days a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.84,0:29:43.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}在我看来 那个村子应该不会
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.84,0:29:43.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And that doesn't look like the sort of village, to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.84,0:29:46.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}欢迎大量食客涌入
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.84,0:29:46.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}that would welcome that many people turning up.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.12,0:29:49.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我不想再惹怒一个村子 我已经干过这种事了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.12,0:29:49.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And I don't wanna piss another village off. I've done that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.08,0:29:57.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}有这么多酒吧待售 真是令人沮丧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.08,0:29:57.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}The sheer volume of options was very depressing.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.08,0:30:01.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}那天晚上 我坐在本地的酒吧里
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.08,0:30:01.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And that evening, in my own local,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.52,0:30:06.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}开始意识到酒吧数量的锐减 会造成何种影响了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.52,0:30:06.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I started to realise what effect this pub-cull will have.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.96,0:30:14.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我在想 孤独正成为农村地区的一个大问题
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.96,0:30:14.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And I was just thinking, loneliness is becoming a big issue in rural areas.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.80,0:30:16.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}部分原因是
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.80,0:30:16.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And part of the problem is:
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.00,0:30:20.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}村庄正在失去灵魂
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.00,0:30:20.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}villages are kind of losing their souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.16,0:30:22.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}村里已经没有医生了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.16,0:30:22.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}You don't have a village doctor any more,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.64,0:30:25.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}医生远在五十公里外的健康中心 你还预约不上
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.64,0:30:25.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}he's in a health centre 30 miles away and you can't get an appointment.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.80,0:30:27.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}村里也没有警察了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.80,0:30:27.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}There's no village bobby on the beat.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.88,0:30:30.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}村里没有牧师 没有商店
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.88,0:30:30.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}There's no village vicar. There's no village shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.64,0:30:32.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}没有学校
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.64,0:30:32.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}There's no village school.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.36,0:30:36.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}如果最后连酒吧都没有了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.36,0:30:36.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And if we end up at a point where there's no village pub...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.52,0:30:39.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}那村庄还剩下什么
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.52,0:30:39.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}What is a village?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.28,0:30:42.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}只是一些房子而已
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.28,0:30:42.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It's just some houses.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.88,0:30:45.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}酒吧是村子的中心
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.88,0:30:45.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}The pub's the hub.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.24,0:30:49.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}而且 应该始终如此
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.24,0:30:49.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And it should always be that way...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.44,0:30:54.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}说这话的人正在一个人独饮
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.44,0:30:54.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}said the man sitting at a table for one.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.84,0:31:04.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}现在距离硬粒小麦的最后播种期限 只剩下十天了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.84,0:31:04.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}We were now just ten days from the durum wheat planting deadline,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.60,0:31:08.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}雨还在下个不停
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.60,0:31:08.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}and it was still raining.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.48,0:31:15.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不过 至少查理想到了一个主意
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.48,0:31:15.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}But Charlie had at least found a way to make some profit
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.32,0:31:17.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}从积水的地里赚点钱
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.32,0:31:17.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}from our waterlogged ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.40,0:31:20.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}对英国柳木的需求持续激增
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.40,0:31:20.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}There's been an explosion of demand for English willow,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.64,0:31:24.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}用于满足印度板球超级联赛的需要
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.64,0:31:24.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}to supply the appetite of Indian Premier League cricket.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.40,0:31:29.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}他们需要英国产的柳木
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.40,0:31:29.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And what they really want is British willow.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.20,0:31:32.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我不想为了制作板球球拍而种树 因为我讨厌板球
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.20,0:31:32.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Obviously I don't want to be growing cricket bats 'cause I loathe cricket.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.36,0:31:33.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我知道 那个
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.36,0:31:33.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, I know. That's, er...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.08,0:31:36.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不过还不算太糟 如果是制作高尔夫球杆就更糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.08,0:31:36.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}But it could be worse, it could be growing golf clubs.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.36,0:31:40.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}所以是我买下那些树 对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.36,0:31:40.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Anyway, so, I buy the trees, is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.24,0:31:43.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我们花很少的钱把树种下去
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.24,0:31:43.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}We pay a small price to have the trees planted,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.68,0:31:45.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}他们负责管理
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.68,0:31:45.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}and then they're managed,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.36,0:31:49.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}他们每年来三次 清理长在树上的植物
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.36,0:31:49.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}these guys pop out three times a year to just clear all the growth off them,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.04,0:31:53.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}12到15年后 他们会来砍树
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.04,0:31:53.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}and then 12, 15 years later, they'll come and harvest them.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.68,0:31:56.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}15年 15年 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.68,0:31:56.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}15 years? 15 years, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.76,0:32:00.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这个超长期商业计划
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.76,0:32:00.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}This incredibly long-term business plan
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.56,0:32:03.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}是一个叫乔希的人想出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.56,0:32:03.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}was the brainchild of a man called Josh.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.20,0:32:05.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你好 你好 查理 你好吗 你好
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.20,0:32:05.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Hello, Charlie. How're you doing? Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.20,0:32:06.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我很好
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.20,0:32:06.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Good, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.76,0:32:07.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}就是这些树吗
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.76,0:32:07.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}These are the trees?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.76,0:32:11.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}需要你们帮忙搬防鹿网 如果不行 就搬种树的工具
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.76,0:32:11.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I need you to carry the deer guards or the planting device here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.32,0:32:14.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不 过来 狗狗们 过来
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.32,0:32:14.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}No, come here! Dogs! Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.60,0:32:17.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}抱歉 乔希 没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.60,0:32:17.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Come here! Sorry, Josh. That's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.20,0:32:18.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}珊莎 坐下
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.20,0:32:18.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Sansa, sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.88,0:32:20.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}坐下
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.88,0:32:20.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Sansa, sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.52,0:32:22.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不是"拉屎" 坐下
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.52,0:32:22.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}No, not "shit", sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.84,0:32:23.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}珊莎
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.84,0:32:23.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Sansa!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.84,0:32:26.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}该死 它们太不听话了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.84,0:32:26.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Fucking hell. They're worse than ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.12,0:32:30.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你说树龄有多少年了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.12,0:32:30.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So, how old did you say those were?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.44,0:32:32.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}四年多了 四五年 四年
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.44,0:32:32.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So they're four years oldish. Four years?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.04,0:32:36.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你选的这块地是沼泽 你知道吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.04,0:32:36.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}You do realise this area you've chosen is a swamp.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.72,0:32:37.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}那很好
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.72,0:32:37.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}That's perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.32,0:32:40.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}就是要沼泽 真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.32,0:32:40.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Really? That's the idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.20,0:32:42.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}那片地没有得到充分利用 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.20,0:32:42.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Basically, that land is underutilised. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.84,0:32:44.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}所以产生不了多少收益 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.84,0:32:44.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So it's not earning you money. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.88,0:32:46.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}以后会产生很高的收益 等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.88,0:32:46.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It's about to. So, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.04,0:32:48.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}可以帮我算算这笔账吗 行
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.04,0:32:48.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Can you talk me through the finances? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.00,0:32:52.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}每棵树我付你多少钱
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.00,0:32:52.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Because I pay you how much for a tree?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.16,0:32:55.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}树苗加护网是20英镑 这些是15英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.16,0:32:55.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So, 20 pounds for the tree and the guard, 15 on top for those.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.00,0:32:57.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}所以每棵树35英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.00,0:32:57.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So, 35 pounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.56,0:32:59.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}35英镑 而你 包种植
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.56,0:32:59.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}35 pounds... It's planted.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.32,0:33:02.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}15年后砍树 是吧 15到20年
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.32,0:33:02.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}We harvest them in 15 years? 15 to 20.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.24,0:33:06.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}树木长成后 按现在的价格计算 价值七百英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.24,0:33:06.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So, at the other end, when they're ready, in today's prices, they're worth 700 pounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.80,0:33:09.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这里有12棵 所以就是
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.80,0:33:09.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And there's a dozen. So that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.52,0:33:12.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}八千两百英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.52,0:33:12.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}8,200 pounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.28,0:33:14.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}回报是八千英镑 但是到时候我已经
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.28,0:33:14.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So we get 8,000 back. But I will be...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.76,0:33:16.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}是八千四百英镑 抱歉 84岁了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.76,0:33:16.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}8,400. 84 years old...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.12,0:33:20.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}也就是说 我已经死了十年了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.12,0:33:20.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}By which I mean I'll have been dead for ten years.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.16,0:33:23.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}那边有些柳树 可以用来制作板球球拍吗
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.16,0:33:23.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}We've got some willows. Could we use those for cricket bats?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.88,0:33:25.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}那些柳树可能不符合要求
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.88,0:33:25.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}There is a chance that it's not quite the right willow.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.08,0:33:28.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}谁把那棵树的树枝都砍光了 是你干的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.08,0:33:28.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Who's lopped that one down? Is that something to do with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.72,0:33:29.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我砍的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.72,0:33:29.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I've done it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.08,0:33:31.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}为什么要把一棵柳树的树枝砍光
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.08,0:33:31.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Why have you cut a bloody great willow down?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.80,0:33:34.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}因为它旁边有一条小路 所以呢
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.80,0:33:34.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}There's a footpath running next to it. Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.64,0:33:38.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}树枝伸到了小路的上方 而且有些枝杈
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.64,0:33:38.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It was sort of leaning over the footpath and there were bits splitting off it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.24,0:33:39.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这些枝杈不是落在行人身上
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.24,0:33:39.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And rather than land on somebody...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.72,0:33:41.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}那不是一棵白蜡树吗 不是
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.72,0:33:41.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I thought that was an ash. No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.72,0:33:44.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}为了救一个漫步的人 你已经砍了一棵树了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.72,0:33:44.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, that's to save a rambler's life, you've killed a tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.12,0:33:48.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}没错 现在议会
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.12,0:33:48.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yes. And now the council's...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.44,0:33:51.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}他们找我的麻烦 因为我没有维护好那条小路
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.44,0:33:51.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I've got into trouble with them 'cause I've made a mess of the footpath.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.12,0:33:54.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}谁说的 我收到一封信
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.12,0:33:54.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Who said that? I got a letter from the c...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.36,0:33:57.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}"尊敬的克拉克森先生 你未能维护好"
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.36,0:33:57.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}"Dear... Mr. Clarkson, you've made a mess of the..."
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.08,0:33:59.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你是说我收到了一封议会来的信
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.08,0:33:59.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}You mean I've had a letter from the council.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.64,0:34:01.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}是的 但是寄给我了 哪个议会
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.64,0:34:01.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, but they sent it to me. From which council?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.88,0:34:03.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我们最喜欢的议会
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.88,0:34:03.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Our favourite council.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.56,0:34:10.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不说这个了 一棵树 可以制作多少个板球球拍
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.56,0:34:10.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Anyway. Erm... How many cricket bats, then, do you get from a tree?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.96,0:34:12.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}平均35个
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.96,0:34:12.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}We work to an average of 35.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.64,0:34:15.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}能卖多少钱
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.64,0:34:15.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And how much do they sell those for?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.04,0:34:17.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}一个球拍能卖大约九百英镑 在一些地方
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.04,0:34:17.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}A cricket bat can go for about 900 pounds in some places.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.84,0:34:18.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}什么
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.84,0:34:18.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.68,0:34:21.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}谁会花九百英镑买一个板球球拍
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.68,0:34:21.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Who's going to pay 900 pounds for a cricket bat?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.00,0:34:23.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}现在需求旺盛
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.00,0:34:23.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It's a lot. It's in high demand at the moment,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.80,0:34:27.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}因为美国 印度 巴基斯坦 那里的小孩子 球员收入几百万
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.80,0:34:27.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}thanks to, you know, America, India, Pakistan, players being paid millions.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.88,0:34:29.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}他们只买英国柳木
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.88,0:34:29.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And it's always English willow?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.36,0:34:31.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}英国柳木是最好的 我们有最适宜的气候
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.36,0:34:31.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It's the best. We have the best climate for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.28,0:34:34.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}好 那就种吧 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.28,0:34:34.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Okay. Let's get them in the ground. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.36,0:34:41.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我要开始了 准备好了吗 嗯 来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.36,0:34:41.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Here I go. Ready? Yeah, go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.64,0:34:44.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}对 然后用力晃几下
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.64,0:34:44.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}There you go. Now give it a real good wiggle.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.48,0:34:47.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}把土踩实
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.48,0:34:47.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Heel it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.48,0:34:51.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这样就行了 你满意了 行了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.48,0:34:51.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And that's it ? You're happy? Done.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.48,0:34:56.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}栽种这些奇怪的 没有根的板球树
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.48,0:34:56.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}The planting of these weird rootless cricket trees
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.16,0:34:58.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}也不是没有危险
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.16,0:34:58.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}was not without complications.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.72,0:35:00.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}老天 天哪
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.72,0:35:00.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Ooh, my God! Jesus Christ!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.56,0:35:02.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你真的陷进去了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.56,0:35:02.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Are you actually sinking there?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.76,0:35:05.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}说真的 那只是
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.76,0:35:05.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Look, I mean, honestly, that's just... Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.92,0:35:10.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}面临着失去宝贵摄影师的风险
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.92,0:35:10.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And so, when we were in danger of losing valuable cameramen...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.56,0:35:13.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}本 抓住我 我把靴子拔出来
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.56,0:35:13.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Ben, grab me. I'll get my boot out.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.36,0:35:19.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我们决定英勇撤退 把种树的事交给乔希
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.36,0:35:19.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}We decided to beat a brave retreat and leave Josh to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.00,0:35:21.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}珊莎 艾莉亚
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.00,0:35:21.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Sansa, Arya!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.96,0:35:24.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}狗狗们
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.96,0:35:24.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Dogs?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.52,0:35:27.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}珊莎 艾莉亚
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.52,0:35:27.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Sansa, Arya!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.48,0:35:30.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我再也不带它们出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.48,0:35:30.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}That's the last time I'm bringing them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.52,0:35:39.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}两天后 天上的窟窿仍然敞开着
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.52,0:35:39.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Two days later, with the heavens still firmly open,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.76,0:35:45.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我和卡莱布以及当地的其他农民 回到了那家酒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.76,0:35:45.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I went back to the boozer with Kaleb and various other local farmers
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.52,0:35:49.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}讨论这种阴雨天气 会对我们造成多大的影响
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.52,0:35:49.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}to discuss just how much this wet weather was killing us.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.40,0:35:55.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我记得是12月8号开始下雨的 但是好像
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.40,0:35:55.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I thought it was December the 8th it started raining. But I think...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.52,0:35:57.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}10月18号 是12月18号吗 好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.52,0:35:57.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}18th of October. Was it the 18th of October?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.12,0:35:59.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}然后我们
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.12,0:35:59.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And then... That was it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.72,0:36:01.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}就是那天 然后我们就没有
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.72,0:36:01.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And we haven't really had...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.36,0:36:02.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}是的 农活就完全停滞了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.36,0:36:02.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}No, we haven't turned a wheel properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.16,0:36:04.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我从没见过这种天气 太极端了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.16,0:36:04.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, I've never known anything like this. This is biblical.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.84,0:36:06.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}而且也没有冷天
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.84,0:36:06.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Because we've had no cold weather either.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.56,0:36:08.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}往年会有一个礼拜的严重霜冻天气
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.56,0:36:08.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Normally, you'd get a week of really heavy frosts,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.92,0:36:12.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}将土壤中的水气抽出来 然后是一段干燥期
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.92,0:36:12.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}it kind of draws the moisture out of the soil, and you'll get a dry time afterwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.80,0:36:15.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}今年一直是温暖潮湿的天气
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.80,0:36:15.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It's just been mild and wet continuously.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.60,0:36:18.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}去年秋天在黏土上栽种的冬季作物 正在蒙受损失
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.60,0:36:18.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}The winter crops that went in last autumn are suffering on heavier land
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.04,0:36:20.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}因为全都泡在水里
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.04,0:36:20.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}because they're just sitting in water.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.60,0:36:22.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}作物正在变黄 快被淹死了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.60,0:36:22.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}They're turning yellow and they're drowning in the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.40,0:36:26.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}今天早上我看的一份报告 就是这么说的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.40,0:36:26.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}That's what it said in one of the reports I was reading this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.92,0:36:30.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}很多农民认为会颗粒无收
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.92,0:36:30.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}There's a number of farmers who just don't think they'll have a harvest.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.32,0:36:31.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}是的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.32,0:36:31.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.76,0:36:35.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我们有 大约一千公顷的春季大麦
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.76,0:36:35.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}We've got, well, about 2,500 acres of spring crops to try and get in,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.68,0:36:39.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}需要在十天到两个星期内收割
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.68,0:36:39.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}spring barley, in the next ten days, two weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.56,0:36:41.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 如果这场雨再下两个礼拜
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.56,0:36:41.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So if this rain doesn't stop in the next two weeks,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.16,0:36:44.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}那一千公顷的庄稼
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.16,0:36:44.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}we'll have 2,000 acres of...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.72,0:36:46.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}就荒了 颗粒无收
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.72,0:36:46.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Nothing. Bare fields.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.80,0:36:48.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我也差不多 差不多
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.80,0:36:48.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Probably the same, yeah. Same?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.36,0:36:50.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}是的 显然 联合收割机市场
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.36,0:36:50.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. For the first time...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.64,0:36:53.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}二手市场的收割机已经泛滥成灾了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.64,0:36:53.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Apparently, the second-hand combine market, is flooded...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.92,0:36:55.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}请原谅我一语双关
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.92,0:36:55.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Pardon the pun. But it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.12,0:36:59.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}大家都在卖掉自己的收割机 因为没有东西可以收割
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.12,0:36:59.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}People are selling their combines because they're not gonna have anything to cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.76,0:37:03.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}但我一直在想 面对风险和压力
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.76,0:37:03.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}But I have been thinking, the risk and the stress and all of the worry
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.16,0:37:06.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}对于天气的担忧 价格等等
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.16,0:37:06.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}about the weather and the prices and so on,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.08,0:37:08.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}如果将农场的所有土地
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.08,0:37:08.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}is it not just easier to say,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.48,0:37:13.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}都纳入可持续农业激励计划
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.48,0:37:13.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}"Sod it, I'll put the entire farm into a Sustainable Farming Incentive,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.20,0:37:14.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}SFI计划等政府计划 会否更轻松一些
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.20,0:37:14.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}SFI, scheme, government scheme?"
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.84,0:37:17.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我们一个月前就是这样做的
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.84,0:37:17.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}That is exactly where we were a month ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.96,0:37:21.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}通过这个计划 我们谈妥了一个价格
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.96,0:37:21.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}With the scheme, we've got an agreed price that we're all gonna get
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.28,0:37:24.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}只要种植一种非粮食作物 就能拿到补贴
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.28,0:37:24.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}from a crop that's not being used for human food,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.16,0:37:27.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}但我们对未来心里有底 知道收入从何而来
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.16,0:37:27.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}but we know where we're going, we know where the income's coming from.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.96,0:37:29.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不愁没钱支付账单
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.96,0:37:29.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. You can keep your bills being paid.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.96,0:37:33.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}把日子过下去 我们有75%的农场土地加入了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.96,0:37:33.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}To keep going. 75% of our farm is going into...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.16,0:37:34.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}计划 对 计划
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.16,0:37:34.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Schemes. Yeah, a scheme.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.88,0:37:37.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我们有多少 10%还是15% 对 现在是10%
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.88,0:37:37.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}What are we? 10? Yeah. 10 or 15. Yeah, 10%.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.96,0:37:39.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我们只有大约10%
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.96,0:37:39.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}We're only probably 10%.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.84,0:37:44.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}如果今年有10%的土地不种粮食
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.84,0:37:44.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}But that means if 10% of the land is being taken out of food production this year,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.04,0:37:46.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}再加上这种天气
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.04,0:37:46.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}and we've got this weather...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.36,0:37:49.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}是啊 休耕的土地会有很多
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.36,0:37:49.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, it's how much is actually gonna be left fallow.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.52,0:37:52.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这会造成小麦和大麦短缺
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.52,0:37:52.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I mean, there's going to be a shortage of wheat and barley.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.36,0:37:56.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}一定会 是的 但是人终究是要吃饭的
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.36,0:37:56.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}There is. Yeah. And ultimately, people have to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.24,0:37:57.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}没错
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.24,0:37:57.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.92,0:37:58.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}确实
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.92,0:37:58.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.84,0:38:08.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}距离查理的最后播种期限 还剩七天的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.84,0:38:08.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Seven days before Charlie's planting deadline,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.24,0:38:12.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}雨终于停了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.24,0:38:12.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}the rain finally stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.36,0:38:16.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}但地里还是太湿了 什么都种不了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.36,0:38:16.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}But, the fields were still far too wet to plant anything in them.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.12,0:38:20.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}于是我开始 劳神费力地阅读积压的文件
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.12,0:38:20.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So I went off to wade through a backlog of paperwork.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.96,0:38:23.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}老天爷
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.96,0:38:23.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}God Almighty.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.48,0:38:28.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这时查理打来电话 从一百年前打来的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.48,0:38:28.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And that's when Charlie called, from a hundred years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.92,0:38:34.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我一直在考虑 播种硬粒小麦之前土地垦殖的事
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.92,0:38:34.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Erm, I've been thinking about cultivations before we drill this durum.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.20,0:38:38.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我觉得我们应该犁地
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.20,0:38:38.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And I think that we should plough it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.28,0:38:40.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}什么
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.28,0:38:40.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.28,0:38:46.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}等一下 抱歉 从1926年之后 就没有人犁地了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.28,0:38:46.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Hang on, sorry. I thought people hadn't ploughed the soils since about 1926.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.44,0:38:49.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不 犁地还是有用的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.44,0:38:49.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}No, it still has a useful place...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.44,0:38:52.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}查理解释说 犁地能在不使用化学品的情况下
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.44,0:38:52.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Charlie explained that ploughing would kill the weeds
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.28,0:38:54.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}清除杂草
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.28,0:38:54.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}without using chemicals,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.24,0:38:58.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}更重要的是 还有助于土壤更快变干
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.24,0:38:58.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}and, crucially, help dry out the soil more quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.32,0:39:02.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这能让我们
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.32,0:39:02.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I think we'll also get the durum wheat in
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.32,0:39:06.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}在下雨的间歇期 及时将硬粒小麦种上
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.32,0:39:06.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}in a more timely fashion between these sort of showers, rain events.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.40,0:39:08.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我认为这是必要的举措
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.40,0:39:08.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm just thinking it's probably what's required.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.80,0:39:11.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}好 那就犁吧 犁地
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.80,0:39:11.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Right, so, ploughing. Ploughing.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.00,0:39:16.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}对于犁地一无所知的我
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.00,0:39:16.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Not knowing anything about ploughing,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.40,0:39:19.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}立刻就租来了我能找到的最大的犁
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.40,0:39:19.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I immediately rented the biggest one I could find.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.48,0:39:21.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}犁很不错
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.48,0:39:21.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And that was great...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.32,0:39:28.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}但是使用手册堪比天书
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.32,0:39:28.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}but it came with an instruction manual written in gibberish.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.64,0:39:32.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}"为后挂装置计算前方的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.64,0:39:32.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}"Calculation of minimum ballasting value at front,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.88,0:39:36.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}最低配重值"
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.88,0:39:36.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}GV min, for rear-mounting implement.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.08,0:39:41.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}"最小总值等于总牵引载荷
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.08,0:39:41.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}GV min equals GHX, bracket, C plus D, brackets,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.20,0:39:44.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}总垂直力B+"
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.20,0:39:44.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}dash TVXB plus.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.92,0:39:50.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}"如果不改变拖拉机的后轮间距
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.92,0:39:50.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}If the distance between the tractor's rear wheels is not to be altered,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.68,0:39:54.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}则更有可能通过横向调整三点
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.68,0:39:54.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}it is additionally possible to reduce the side pull
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.32,0:39:56.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}来减少侧拉力"
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.32,0:39:56.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}by laterally adjusting the three-point..."
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.80,0:40:00.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}谢天谢地 农场经理在此时赶到了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.80,0:40:00.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Thankfully, at this moment, the farm manager arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.56,0:40:03.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你好 你好 你好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.56,0:40:03.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}All right? Are you all right, mate?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.36,0:40:06.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}还不赖 你呢 我租了一个犁
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.36,0:40:06.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, not bad. You? I've got a plough.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.16,0:40:07.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}查理说要犁地
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.16,0:40:07.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Charlie says we've gotta plough.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.76,0:40:09.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我和查理谈过犁地的事了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.76,0:40:09.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I've been speaking to Charlie about the ploughing
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.84,0:40:11.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}只是没想到他会租这么大的犁
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.84,0:40:11.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}but I didn't know he was gonna get this big of a plough.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.56,0:40:14.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不 是我租的 一猜就是你
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.56,0:40:14.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}No, I got that. I kinda gathered that!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.04,0:40:17.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我看不懂说明书
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.04,0:40:17.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Why... I can't understand the instruction book.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.48,0:40:19.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你什么时候看过说明书了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.48,0:40:19.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}When have you ever read the instruction book?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.24,0:40:20.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}嗯 我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.24,0:40:20.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, no, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.48,0:40:26.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}卡莱布也承认说明书是胡说八道
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.48,0:40:26.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Kaleb conceded the instruction manual was nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.60,0:40:27.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}什么
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.60,0:40:27.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.52,0:40:31.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}所以他提出来帮我
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.52,0:40:31.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So, he offered to give me a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.76,0:40:36.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}仪表盘上新出现了一大堆报警标志
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.76,0:40:36.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I've got a vast range of new warning symbols on the dashboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.04,0:40:39.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}干得不错
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.04,0:40:39.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Well done!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.72,0:40:40.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}好 这是软管
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.72,0:40:40.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Right, now it's your hoses.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.12,0:40:42.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}可以让它们浮起来吗
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.12,0:40:42.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Can you float them all for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.32,0:40:45.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}什么 让它们浮起来
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.32,0:40:45.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}What? Put them into Float.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.12,0:40:47.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}"浮起来"是什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.12,0:40:47.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}What do you mean, "put them in the float"?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.96,0:40:49.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你把它们浮起来了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.96,0:40:49.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I don't know what you... Have you put them into Float?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.52,0:40:50.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我不懂你在说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.52,0:40:50.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I don't know what that means!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.12,0:40:53.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}老天
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.12,0:40:53.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, God...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.04,0:40:55.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这些是液压滑阀
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.04,0:40:55.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}These are your hydraulic spools, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.56,0:40:57.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}要让它们浮起来 后面有一个按钮
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.56,0:40:57.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}To float them, there's a button on the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.32,0:40:59.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}嗯 按下这个按钮 然后点那个
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.32,0:40:59.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. Pull that button in and hit that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.52,0:41:02.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}把它们浮起来更易于操作 管子也更容易进去
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.52,0:41:02.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It makes it easier, then every pipe will go in easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.84,0:41:05.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}比如这是那个的颜色 杰哥
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.84,0:41:05.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}To say this is the colour of that... G-Dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.48,0:41:06.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.48,0:41:06.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.76,0:41:09.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}他现在说的话比你的话还要难懂
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.76,0:41:09.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}He's making even less sense than you at the minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.32,0:41:14.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我的车厢后面有一把铲子 它会爆发的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.32,0:41:14.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I've got a spade in the back of my van! He's getting there big time!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.92,0:41:17.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}有过一次 就一定会有第二次
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.92,0:41:17.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}When you've had one, you're always subject to the second one.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.64,0:41:19.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}就像在花园里挖坑
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.64,0:41:19.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It's like digging your garden.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.56,0:41:22.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}对 这台拖拉机拖那个完全没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.56,0:41:22.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, that tractor will romp along with that all right,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.56,0:41:23.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}放心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.56,0:41:23.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}don't worry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.20,0:41:25.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}好的 对
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.20,0:41:25.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yes. Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.12,0:41:28.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}它能胜任 放心
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.12,0:41:28.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}He's gotta cut that out, he has! What's up then?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.80,0:41:32.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你还记得这个农场 上一次犁地是什么时候吗
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.80,0:41:32.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Can you remember when the last time anyone ploughed this farm was?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.88,0:41:35.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我记得你见过
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.88,0:41:35.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I can remember when that happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.52,0:41:39.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}当时加扎在纽卡斯尔队踢球
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.52,0:41:39.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Gazza was playing for Newcastle,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.96,0:41:42.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}而不是做他有一半时间都在做的事
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.96,0:41:42.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}instead of doing what he does half the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.60,0:41:44.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}嗯 等你弄清楚之后
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.60,0:41:44.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. When you've got a clear thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.84,0:41:46.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你可以用它做任何事
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.84,0:41:46.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}you can do anything with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.32,0:41:49.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}它从来没有用八片犁犁过
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.32,0:41:49.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It's never been ploughed with an eight-furrow before up there anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.88,0:41:52.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}傻站着干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.88,0:41:52.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}What's up there, now?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.92,0:42:01.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}为兰博基尼装好犁后 我们前往地里去干活了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.92,0:42:01.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}With the plough attached to the Lambo, we headed off to the fields to start work.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.60,0:42:05.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}左下角 按下去
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.60,0:42:05.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Bottom left. Now press it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.56,0:42:11.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}老天 这玩意够先进的
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.56,0:42:11.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}God, there's some engineering in that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.00,0:42:17.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}太神奇了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.00,0:42:17.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.32,0:42:19.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你觉得它有多重 五吨
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.32,0:42:19.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}How much do you reckon that weighs? Five tons?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.64,0:42:20.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}四吨 对
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.64,0:42:20.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Four ton? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.72,0:42:23.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}它的入土深度有15厘米
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.72,0:42:23.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And it's gonna be six inches into the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.64,0:42:26.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}是的 那就是所谓的地锚
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.64,0:42:26.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. That is called a land anchor.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.52,0:42:27.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.52,0:42:27.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.52,0:42:29.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}现在让你见识一下 大马力拖拉机的威力
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.52,0:42:29.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Now you're gonna see what a powerful tractor can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.44,0:42:34.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}开始 手油门启动
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.44,0:42:34.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Here we go. Hand throttle engaged.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.12,0:42:38.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你将第一次见识到
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.12,0:42:38.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}You're about to see, for the first time,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.20,0:42:41.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}兰博基尼的实力
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.20,0:42:41.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}the true power of the Lamborghini.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.24,0:42:45.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}开始犁地了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.24,0:42:45.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm ploughing!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.60,0:42:48.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}土地太湿了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.60,0:42:48.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Unbelievably wet field.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.96,0:42:51.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}好样的
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.96,0:42:51.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.96,0:42:53.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.96,0:42:53.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.00,0:42:56.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}他根本不知道自己在做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.00,0:42:56.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I don't think he has a fucking clue what he's doing.
