Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.68,0:43:02.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Kaleb, we've got a little bit of wheelspin.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.12,0:43:04.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}如果我是你 就把犁抬起来
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.12,0:43:04.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So if I was you, lift it out the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.32,0:43:08.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}试着离开这个湿滑区域
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.32,0:43:08.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Try and get out of this wet bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.68,0:43:15.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}准备好了吗 来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.68,0:43:15.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Ready? Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.76,0:43:24.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不费吹灰之力
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.76,0:43:24.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Barely noticing its workload.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.24,0:43:26.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}把犁放下来
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.24,0:43:26.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Drop the plough down!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.20,0:43:28.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}放下来
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.20,0:43:28.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Drop it down!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.36,0:43:32.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}难以置信 你在给土地挠痒痒
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.36,0:43:32.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Unbelievable. You're only skimming the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.16,0:43:36.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}通常情况下 要给田地除草
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.16,0:43:36.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}What you normally do to get rid of the weeds in a field
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.92,0:43:39.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你会使用除草剂
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.92,0:43:39.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}is you use weed killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.32,0:43:43.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}但是这会让化学物质进入土壤 没有人希望这样
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.32,0:43:43.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}But that puts chemicals into the soil. Nobody wants that.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.00,0:43:46.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}犁地能把土壤翻上来
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.00,0:43:46.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}If you plough, you turn the soil over
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.52,0:43:52.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}让杂草失去阳光和氧气 然后死掉
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.52,0:43:52.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}so that the weeds are deprived of light and oxygen and then they die.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.20,0:43:54.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}所以你会觉得 "好极了 那就犁地吧"
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.20,0:43:54.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So you'd think, "Great, do ploughing."
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.92,0:43:59.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}但是土壤翻上来后 会释放碳
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.92,0:43:59.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}But if you turn the soil over, you're releasing the carbon
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.00,0:44:04.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}然后碳会升到天上 然后格蕾塔·通贝里会很不高兴
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.00,0:44:04.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}and then that goes up into the sky and then Greta Thunberg has a paddy fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.76,0:44:08.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}种田就是这样 一场永无休止的打地鼠游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.76,0:44:08.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}This is farming. It's the constant game of Whack-a-mole.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.16,0:44:11.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}解决了一个问题 又有新问题冒出来
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.16,0:44:11.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}You solve one problem and create another.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.28,0:44:16.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你想让我为你生产粮食吗 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.28,0:44:16.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Do you want me to produce food for you? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.64,0:44:19.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}那么你想让我污染天空或土壤吗
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.64,0:44:19.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So, do you want me to hurt the sky or the soil?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.76,0:44:21.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这是你的选择
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.76,0:44:21.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Those are your choices.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.12,0:44:25.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}等我跑完一圈下来
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.12,0:44:25.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}When I reached the end of my first run,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.64,0:44:27.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}卡莱布指出 其实
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.64,0:44:27.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Kaleb pointed out that, actually,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.80,0:44:31.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我并没有污染天空或土壤
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.80,0:44:31.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I hadn't hurt the sky or the soil.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.68,0:44:34.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我从没见过这么烂的犁地技术
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.68,0:44:34.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}That is the shittest bit of ploughing I've ever seen in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.12,0:44:37.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}那你想让我怎么犁
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.12,0:44:37.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, how could I have done it any differently?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.36,0:44:40.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}把犁放进土里 你看 你只是在表面滑动
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.36,0:44:40.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Drop it in the ground. Look, you're only skimming the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.36,0:44:43.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}显然 我又一次能力不足了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.36,0:44:43.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Obviously, I'd been incompetent again.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.52,0:44:47.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不过卡莱布也承认 鉴于土壤太湿
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.52,0:44:47.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}But, Kaleb reckoned that because the soil was so wet,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.72,0:44:50.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}无论如何也不可能成功
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.72,0:44:50.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}we were on a hiding to nothing anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.56,0:44:52.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我觉得地太湿了 伙计 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.56,0:44:52.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I think it's way too wet, mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.60,0:44:55.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}那台拖拉机试着拖动全部八片犁 那是一个锚
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.60,0:44:55.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}That tractor's trying to pull all them eight furrows, that's an anchor.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.80,0:44:59.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}对吧 我说了 是个地锚 对 把土壤翻起来
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.80,0:44:59.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yes? I said, it's a land anchor. Yeah, through the soil.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.44,0:45:01.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}对 所以它需要更大的抓地力
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.44,0:45:01.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yes. So it needs much more traction.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.64,0:45:04.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}没错 好在我们有 我给它换上了新轮胎
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.64,0:45:04.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yes, which luckily I've got 'cause I've got new tyres on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.56,0:45:06.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}是的 你换了 但是 270匹马力
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.56,0:45:06.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yes, you have, but... 270 horsepower.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.12,0:45:07.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}但是
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.12,0:45:07.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}But...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.08,0:45:09.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}它就是用来干这个的 你不同意吗
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.08,0:45:09.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}This is what it was built to do, would you not agree?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.12,0:45:16.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我迫切想要证明 我的老朋友能够挽回败局
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.12,0:45:16.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Desperate to prove that my old friend would save the day,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.40,0:45:20.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}为此我又跑了一圈
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.40,0:45:20.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I went for another run.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.12,0:45:22.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}放下犁
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.12,0:45:22.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Sinking plough.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.56,0:45:26.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}犁 很好
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.56,0:45:26.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Plough. That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.96,0:45:28.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}好吧 走起来
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.96,0:45:28.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Right, here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.00,0:45:31.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}转速上升
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.00,0:45:31.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Building up revs.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.00,0:45:35.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}加油 威猛的兰博基尼
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.00,0:45:35.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Come on, mighty Lamborghini.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.36,0:45:39.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}老天 轮子在打滑
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.36,0:45:39.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}God, I've got some wheelspin.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.60,0:45:41.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}打滑很厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.60,0:45:41.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}A lot of wheelspin.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.12,0:45:44.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}加油 你可以的 加油
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.12,0:45:44.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Come on, you can do it. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.84,0:45:45.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}加油
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.84,0:45:45.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.48,0:45:50.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}然而 当巨大的犁插入土壤后
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.48,0:45:50.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}But, with the enormous plough actually in the soil,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.64,0:45:52.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我寸步难行
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.64,0:45:52.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I was going nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.16,0:45:55.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}它不喜欢这块地
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.16,0:45:55.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It does not like this bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.08,0:45:58.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.08,0:45:58.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.20,0:46:04.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}哇
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.20,0:46:04.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.00,0:46:06.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我们很吃力
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.00,0:46:06.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}We are struggling here.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.84,0:46:10.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这块地大概太湿了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.84,0:46:10.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I think it's probably too wet.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.40,0:46:12.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}见鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.40,0:46:12.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.96,0:46:18.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}通过犁地让这块地变干的计划失败了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.96,0:46:18.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Drying this field with a plough, then, had not worked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.12,0:46:21.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}尽管我的老兰博基尼非常棒
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.12,0:46:21.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It had simply been too big a job
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.56,0:46:25.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}对它来说 这项任务还是过于艰巨了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.56,0:46:25.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}for even my wonderful old Lambo.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.40,0:46:35.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不过几天后 我的新拖拉机到了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.40,0:46:35.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}A couple of days later, though, my new tractor arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.80,0:46:40.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}最后我把范围缩小到了芬特 带拉杆的新荷兰 以及凯斯
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.80,0:46:40.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So, I got it down to Fendt, New Holland, with the levers in it, and the Case.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.32,0:46:41.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.32,0:46:41.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.96,0:46:47.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}看啊
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.96,0:46:47.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Ha-ha! Check it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.08,0:46:49.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}看
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.08,0:46:49.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Check it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.76,0:46:52.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}又是一台兰博基尼
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.76,0:46:52.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It's a Lamborghini again!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.44,0:47:03.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我们不用继续找了 你说是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.44,0:47:03.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Our quest is at an end, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.32,0:47:05.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}所以你就买了这台
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.32,0:47:05.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So you just went out and bought this...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.32,0:47:06.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}它用了多少个小时了 五百
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.32,0:47:06.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}How many hours has it done? 500.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.64,0:47:08.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}三千 我是说三千
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.64,0:47:08.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}3,000. I meant 3,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.08,0:47:10.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}等一下 你看
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.08,0:47:10.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}But hang on, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.20,0:47:13.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}好小一只 太小了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.20,0:47:13.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}That's so tiny! Really tiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.52,0:47:15.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}酒吧的位置无可挑剔
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.52,0:47:15.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It's the perfect site.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.24,0:47:18.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}现在这个该死的野餐场地
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.24,0:47:18.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I can see that. But now this bloody picnic site.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.52,0:47:48.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}字幕翻译 刘波
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.52,0:47:50.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}创意监督 张珺怡
